  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the EU Exploratory Mission SENEGAL 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The European Union will send an election exploratory mission to Senegal to assess the usefulness, advisability and feasibility of a fully-fledged EU Election Observation Mission for the upcoming Presidential elections scheduled for February 2024. IOM will identify four experts (one electoral/legal expert, one political/media media expert, one logistics expert and one security expert), who will travel to Dakar for approximately 15 days, to collect factual information on the election process, make necessary preliminary logistics enquiries and provide advice on how to organize the operational component of a possible EU EOM and assess the security situation in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
